[statement]
Reduced from postmarketOS v26.06 over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-11), asked for `postmarketos-base-openrc`;
postmarketOS's repository first. It needs `alpine-conf`,
`busybox-mdev-openrc` and `udev-init-scripts-openrc`, in that order;
`alpine-conf` and `udev-init-scripts-openrc`, through its condition, both
come after `openrc`. apk installs `busybox-mdev-openrc`, with `mdev-conf`,
before `alpine-conf`: placing `openrc` reaches `udev-init-scripts-openrc`,
whose condition names `udev-init-scripts`, which nothing installs, and
which provides `dev-openrc`; `busybox-mdev-openrc` provides it too, and is
walked there
(`install-order/a-package-whose-condition-may-hold-leads-to-a-provider-it-does-not-name`).

[repository]
P:postmarketos-base-openrc
V:62-r0
D:alpine-conf busybox-mdev-openrc udev-init-scripts-openrc

[repository]
P:alpine-conf
V:3.22.0-r0
D:openrc>=0.24.1-r6

P:busybox-mdev-openrc
V:1.37.0-r31
D:mdev-conf
p:dev-openrc

P:mdev-conf
V:4.10-r0

P:openrc
V:0.63.2-r0

P:udev-init-scripts-openrc
V:35-r1
p:dev-openrc
i:openrc udev-init-scripts=35-r1

[request]
postmarketos-base-openrc

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install openrc 0.63.2-r0
install mdev-conf 4.10-r0
install busybox-mdev-openrc 1.37.0-r31
install alpine-conf 3.22.0-r0
install udev-init-scripts-openrc 35-r1
install postmarketos-base-openrc 62-r0
